WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.625 --> 00:00:03.001
- I don't like them.

00:00:03.001 --> 00:00:05.096
(funny tuba music)
(hinge squeaking)

00:00:05.096 --> 00:00:08.717
- My name is Oona, and
I'm seven years old.

00:00:08.717 --> 00:00:09.849
- Blake.

00:00:09.849 --> 00:00:10.758
Blaire.

00:00:10.758 --> 00:00:12.653
- Isabella, and I'm nine years old.

00:00:12.653 --> 00:00:14.589
- I'm--
- Five in June.

00:00:14.589 --> 00:00:16.392
- Mommy is chirty-five.

00:00:16.392 --> 00:00:17.447
- I have a lot of pets.

00:00:17.447 --> 00:00:20.541
I have calerpittars that are chrysalis.

00:00:20.541 --> 00:00:21.870
- I want a dog.

00:00:21.870 --> 00:00:22.782
- Sloths.

00:00:22.782 --> 00:00:24.754
They're really cute, and
they take their time.

00:00:24.754 --> 00:00:27.457
- I also have a very tiny toad,

00:00:27.457 --> 00:00:30.746
and a cat, and a fish, and a bird.

00:00:30.746 --> 00:00:33.421
It's a bad combination.

00:00:33.421 --> 00:00:35.001
- No!

00:00:35.001 --> 00:00:35.929
- I like pigs a lot.

00:00:35.929 --> 00:00:36.898
- I would like a pig.

00:00:36.898 --> 00:00:38.460
- They oink too much.

00:00:38.460 --> 00:00:40.457
- They oink too much!

00:00:40.457 --> 00:00:42.233
- I like piglets!

00:00:42.233 --> 00:00:43.267
(murmuring)

00:00:43.267 --> 00:00:45.066
(gasps)

00:00:45.066 --> 00:00:46.146
(pig oinks)

00:00:46.146 --> 00:00:47.191
- No!

00:00:47.191 --> 00:00:49.486
(pig oinks)

00:00:49.486 --> 00:00:51.111
- Oh, my gosh!

00:00:51.111 --> 00:00:52.951
- [Woman] Oh, my god!

00:00:52.951 --> 00:00:54.084
- They're brown?

00:00:54.084 --> 00:00:55.052
(pig oinks)

00:00:55.052 --> 00:00:56.324
- [Woman] You can play with it, Isabella!

00:00:56.324 --> 00:00:57.595
Don't be afraid!

00:00:57.595 --> 00:00:58.911
- I don't wanna hold one.

00:00:58.911 --> 00:01:00.297
- I don't wanna hold one.

00:01:00.297 --> 00:01:01.821
- I feel like they would be heavy.

00:01:01.821 --> 00:01:04.300
(pig oinks)

00:01:04.300 --> 00:01:06.677
I like how they snort.

00:01:06.677 --> 00:01:07.677
It's cute.

00:01:07.677 --> 00:01:08.510
- Pig!

00:01:10.663 --> 00:01:12.462
- No! (whimpers)

00:01:12.462 --> 00:01:13.460
- I have chocolate!

00:01:13.460 --> 00:01:14.293
I have chocolate!

00:01:14.293 --> 00:01:15.218
(cries)
Look!

00:01:15.218 --> 00:01:16.831
- [Woman] Do you want
me to give it to Mommy?

00:01:16.831 --> 00:01:20.267
- Your mouth is so tiny-feeling!

00:01:20.267 --> 00:01:22.283
(pig oinks)
(gasps)

00:01:22.283 --> 00:01:24.616
(pigs oink)

00:01:29.650 --> 00:01:32.767
- I think my cat would get upset at them.

00:01:32.767 --> 00:01:33.600
- Pig!

00:01:33.600 --> 00:01:34.882
Pig!

00:01:34.882 --> 00:01:35.715
Look!

00:01:35.715 --> 00:01:37.087
- Say hi!
(pig oinks)

00:01:37.087 --> 00:01:38.186
- Hi!
(pig oinks)

00:01:38.186 --> 00:01:39.508
- [Woman] She's talking to you!

00:01:39.508 --> 00:01:42.904
- I've never been so surprised before!

00:01:42.904 --> 00:01:46.783
- How did they even know I wanted a pig?

00:01:46.783 --> 00:01:48.370
- It was the best surprise.

00:01:48.370 --> 00:01:50.782
- I don't think they would
wanna be with my cat.

00:01:50.782 --> 00:01:52.693
She's just so feisty,

00:01:52.693 --> 00:01:55.539
and she's in love with my dad's deodorant!

00:01:55.539 --> 00:01:57.117
- I want a toy now.

00:01:57.117 --> 00:01:59.993
(laughter)
- You want a toy?

00:01:59.993 --> 00:02:03.008
- So I tell 'em, "Don't come
to my house with deodorant on!"

00:02:03.008 --> 00:02:06.258
(gentle, upbeat music)

00:02:08.596 --> 00:02:10.910
(quick whoosh)
(hinge squeaking)

